    "text": "By Lillian Ali ,\n11 hours ago From pristine antiques to one-of-a-kind custom vehicles, car lovers had a lot to look at during the Brookfield Chamber of Commerce Car Show on Sunday. The show, which was held at Eight Corners from 8 a.m. to 3 p.m. on Aug. 23, featured dozens of vehicles as well as local vendors and business owners. Read full article",
